ed">[MẪU] HIỂU → THỬ → SỐNG</p></div></div><div data-eb-card="" class="rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border shadow-soft flex flex-col justify-between text-left h-full bg-soft-pink text-deep-navy border-deep-navy/10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="font-ui text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-deep-navy/70">[MẪU] TRỤ CỘT 02</span><h3 class="font-ui font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-deep-navy leading-snug">[MẪU] Tập thương cảm xúc</h3></div><div class="pt-4 border-t border-deep-navy/15 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-6"><p class="font-quote text-base sm:text-lg italic text-bright-magenta leading-relaxed">[MẪU] Vững chãi từ bên trong</p><p class="font-ui text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-deep-navy leading-relaxed">[MẪU] HIỂU → GỌI TÊN → ĐÓN NHẬN &amp; ĐIỀU HÒA</p></div></div><div data-eb-card="" class="rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border shadow-soft flex flex-col justify-between text-left h-full bg-mint-haze text-deep-navy border-deep-navy/10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="font-ui text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-deep-navy/70">[MẪU] TRỤ CỘT 03</span><h3 class="font-ui font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-deep-navy leading-snug">[MẪU] Giao tiếp hài hòa nam tính – nữ tính</h3></div><div class="pt-4 border-t border-deep-navy/15 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-6"><p class="font-quote text-base sm:text-lg italic text-bright-magenta leading-relaxed">[MẪU] Hài hòa với người</p><p class="font-ui text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-deep-navy leading-relaxed">[MẪU] HIỂU → CÂN BẰNG → THỂ HIỆN</p></div></div></div><div data-eb-card="" class="rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-5 border-2 border-dashed border-bright-magenta bg-white/60 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-left"><span class="font-ui text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-bright-magenta shrink-0">[MẪU] NHỊP ĐIỆU TRIỂN KHAI</span><p class="font-ui text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-deep-navy/85 flex-1">[MẪU